{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼半導體解決方案公司正式公佈全新手機圖像傳感器LYTIA 720。這款新品定位於智能手機主攝，採用約5000萬有效像素的堆棧式CMOS架構，傳感器尺寸為1/1.56英寸，對角線長度約10.24毫米，單像素尺寸為1.0微米。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584148.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:52.764574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:19:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_hash":"f56f4f09e1e58e3d700e94425913fcb0f35cf1bdc6c65871cc98d5631eb943cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}